ox !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           庄园践行着包容共生的理念，不论是从周边生物多样性的维护到团队劳动力的组成，大家都以生产高品质的咖啡为坚定使命，而连续几年的好成绩不仅滋养着全球咖啡爱好者的味蕾，更为周边社区百余家庭提供了至关重要的生计来源。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           庄园旗下还有另外一个庄园Finca Ethiopia，现在庄园由David和女儿Sandra共同管理；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Micro